<title>UK: Mirror Group confirms stake in Midland.</title>
<headline>Mirror Group confirms stake in Midland.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British newspaper company Mirror Group Plc said on Friday it had bought a further 10 percent stake in Midland Independent Newspapers Plc at 210p per share under its bid for the firm.</p>
<p>Mirror Group said it bought 13.85 million shares, raising its stake to 34.45 million shares, or 24.98 percent of Midland.</p>
<p>Earlier, dealers said the company had made purchases as part of its bid to buy Midland for 297 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
